<title>USA: Swatch USA says Jonathan Bernstein new president.</title>
<headline>Swatch USA says Jonathan Bernstein new president.</headline>
<dateline>WEEHAWKEN, N.J. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SMH Corp's Swatch USA said Friday Jonathan Bernstein was appointed president of the company.</p>
<p>Swatch said Bernstein joined the company in January as executive vice president.</p>
<p>A company spokeswoman said he replaced Barbara Khouri, who resigned in March to pursue other interests.</p>
